meta {
  name: List Categories
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/client/categories
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # List Active Categories (tree)

  Public endpoint. Returns active root categories with their active children.
  Use this on the order creation screen.

  Root categories and subcategories each have their own icon — a subcategory
  icon does not propagate to its parent group.

  ## Icons

  Always render from `icon_url` (absolute URL, ready to load). The `icon` key
  is internal — do not map it to bundled assets. Pick the renderer by `icon_type`:

  | `icon_type` | File | How to render |
  |-------------|------|---------------|
  | `preset` | monochrome SVG (`/icons/services/{key}.svg`) | `SvgPicture.network`, tint with the app's color |
  | `custom` | admin-uploaded monochrome SVG (`/icons/services/u-{uuid}.svg`; legacy: `/storage/category-icons/*.svg`) | `SvgPicture.network`, tint with the app's color |
  | `image` | raster **WebP** (`/storage/category-images/*.webp`), ≤ 50 KB | `Image.network` — **not** an SVG, do not tint |
  | `null` | — (`icon_url` is `null`) | app's fallback icon |

  `name` is localized by `Accept-Language` (`ru` / `tk`, fallback `ru`).

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Сантехника",
        "name_ru": "Сантехника",
        "name_tk": "Santehnika",
        "parent_id": null,
        "icon_type": "preset",
        "icon": "wrench",
        "icon_url": "http://192.168.31.158:8000/icons/services/wrench.svg",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": 5,
            "name": "Замена смесителя",
            "name_ru": "Замена смесителя",
            "name_tk": "Garyjy çalyşmak",
            "parent_id": 1,
            "is_active": true,
            "icon_type": "image",
            "icon": "category-images/9f1c2e.webp",
            "icon_url": "http://192.168.31.158:8000/storage/category-images/9f1c2e.webp",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T09:52:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-01T13:20:32.000000Z"
          },
          {
            "id": 21,
            "name": "Перетяжка дивана",
            "name_ru": "Перетяжка дивана",
            "name_tk": "Diwan örtmek",
            "parent_id": 19,
            "is_active": true,
            "icon_type": "custom",
            "icon": "u-9936f846-8fae-4324-937e-3e2b2be9f3d8",
            "icon_url": "http://192.168.31.158:8000/icons/services/u-9936f846-8fae-4324-937e-3e2b2be9f3d8.svg",
            "created_at": "2026-08-12T09:52:12.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-01T13:20:32.000000Z"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```

  Rely only on `id`, `name`, `parent_id`, `icon_type`, `icon_url`, `children` —
  other fields are not part of the contract.
}
